ating a spatial penetration effect. Some letters are in front, some behind, forming depth layering and cinematic perspective.\\n\\nLighting: dramatic, cinematic lighting with strong directional highlights. Glossy reflections on the motorcycle surface (carbon fiber, metallic paint), subtle rim light outlining the rider. Controlled shadows, high contrast, premium commercial look.\\n\\nColor palette: dominant red, black, and dark neutral tones, with subtle cool blue highlights. High-end color grading, slightly desaturated background to emphasize subject.\\n\\nTypography layout (clean, Apple-style minimalism):\\nTop center: \\\"ZHANGXUE 820RR\\\"\\nBelow (small caps): \\\"PURE SPEED MACHINE\\\"\\nBottom center Chinese: \\\"张雪机车 820RR\\\"\\nSlogan Chinese: \\\"速度与掌控的极致融合\\\"\\n\\nTypography style: modern sans-serif, precise kerning, strong grid system, minimal yet powerful. No clutter.\\n\\nAtmosphere: futuristic, high-performance, premium brand identity, aggressive yet controlled.\\n\\nCamera: low-angle perspective, 35mm lens feel, depth of field, cinematic framing.\\n\\nRendering: ultra-realistic, 8K detail, commercial photography quality, sharp focus on key elements.\\n\\n--ar 16:9 --style raw --v 6\",\n  \"size\": \"1920x1080\"\n}", "16:9", false, 775982816, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "aspectRatio"}, "shape": 7, "name": "aspectRatio", "label": "aspectRatio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "aspectRatio"}, {"widget": {"name": "skip_error"}, "shape": 7, "name": "skip_error", "label": "skip_error", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "skip_error"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "shape": 7, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "type": "RH_RhartImageG2TextToImage", "mod